%% Scraper failure handling
flowchart TD
    S[Search across sources] --> A{Source A}
    A -- ok --> RA[offers A]
    A -- fail/timeout --> CBA[Circuit breaker A opens]
    S --> B{Source B}
    B -- ok --> RB[offers B]
    CBA --> P[Partial results]
    RA --> P
    RB --> P
    P --> AGENT[Agent proceeds with partial data]
    AGENT --> INFORM[Inform user of degraded coverage]
    CBA -. never .-x CRASH[Crash whole SaaS]
